    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/prime-electronic-store/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Prime Electronic Store is a dynamic, SEO-friendly, and versatile multi-purpose theme designed for electronic retailers, gadget stores, online marketplaces, computer shops, mobile accessory stores, home appliance retailers, gaming console sellers, smart device shops, and tech startups aiming to showcase and sell products effectively. Ideal for consumer electronics, smart gadgets, laptops, smartphones, tablets, cameras, headphones, TVs, gaming accessories, and home automation devices, it supports modern online selling needs. The responsive and retina-ready design ensures a visually sharp experience across all devices, from desktops to mobiles. With customizable banners, product sliders, and category sections, businesses can highlight deals, launches, and trending products easily. Integrated with WooCommerce, it supports smooth product management, payments, carts, and wishlists. Advanced filtering, fast performance, and SEO optimization improve user engagement and search visibility. Social media integration and flexible customization help match any brand identity, making it a strong foundation for growing an electronics business online."
    },
